<title>Abhinanda Mannazhath Nandan | Backend Engineer</title>
<meta name="description" content="Backend engineer in Dresden. Java, Spring Boot, TypeScript, NestJS and PostgreSQL.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
